msgstr "Bun venit la *General Formulation of Quantum Information,* al treilea curs din seria *Understanding Quantum Information and Computation* care cuprinde următoarele cursuri:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "[Basics of quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information)\n"
msgstr "[Basics of quantum information](/learning/courses/basics-of-quantum-information)\n"

